.DS_Store
.nfs*
.env
/.worktrees/
/.zcode/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# 迁移前保留在仓库根目录的本地工作副本。
# 正式内容分别位于 archive/unitree_isaaclab_deploy/、archive/代码存档/ 和 shared/分析记录/。
/unitree_isaaclab_deploy/
/代码存档/
/分析记录/

# Local historical snapshots and downloaded model packages are not active source.
# Curated analysis and provenance records remain versioned under shared/分析记录/.
/archive/代码存档/

# Local evaluation recordings are evidence artifacts, not source files.
/shared/视频存档/

# Trained model weights / checkpoints / exported artifacts are not tracked.
# Obtain them per the SHA256 in each deploy/<route>/ARTIFACTS.md instead.
**/models/*.pkl
**/models/*.pth
**/models/*.onnx
**/ckpt/*.pkl
**/ckpt/*.pth
**/exported/*.onnx

# Personal career materials (résumé / cold-email / application drafts) must
# never enter the public repository. Backed up outside the repo before cleanup.
*保研套磁*
*履历原始材料*
*简历要点*
*比赛文书*
